hebi8 外汇回放 (hebi8-toy) — a Bilibili Toy

Market data
  The one-minute bars in public/data/ are historical bid quotes of USD/JPY,
  EUR/JPY and AUD/JPY taken from the free "Generic ASCII, M1" files of
  HistData.com (https://www.histdata.com/), years 2008, 2011, 2013, 2015,
  2016, 2019, 2020, 2022 and 2024, downloaded 2026-10-12/13.
  Only the windows listed in scripts/scenarios.mjs are kept. Prices are
  unchanged; timestamps are converted to UTC (see scripts/histdata.mjs) and
  one hour that the files repeat on a clock-change Sunday is dropped. Nothing
  is interpolated or synthesised: a minute without a quote is simply absent.
  HistData.com provides the data without any warranty.

